{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017224631648-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017234451\"/><p>行人天橋入口爆水管，噴出約兩層樓高水柱。</p><p>天水圍發生爆水管事件。今日(17日)傍晚6時許，多名市民報案指天榮路11號一小學對開行人天橋地底一條水管爆裂，噴出約兩層樓高水柱，多塊路磚被沖起。水務署人員接報到場關上水掣進行緊急搶修。受事故影響，天頌苑及天悅邨暫停沖廁水供應，料明早7時30分將恢復供水。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T15:59:15.749067+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:46:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T15:57:39.782160+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:57:39.782160+00:00","content_hash":"379c5e11f884993d74b0b7df9fb376604043e63bf3e0b1d64437cdf46b9e8f03","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}